<section>
  <h1>
    {% lucide "user-pen" %} I am ...
  </h1>
  {% renderTemplate "md" %}
  - a PhD student, registered with the University of Oxford, Nuffield Department
  of Medicine; part of the Brasenose College (Apr 2023 - Apr 2027) <br />
  - interested in building Machine Learning models and pipelines for infectious
  disease forecasting, along with stakeholder engagement <br />
  - currently working on building models for dengue forecasting, part of a
  project called [DART](https://www.dartdengue.org) - Dengue Advanced Readiness
  Tools <br />
  - physically based in the Mathematical Modelling group of the Oxford
  University Clinical Research Unit (OUCRU), Ho Chi Minh City, Viet Nam <br />
  - supervised by [Assoc. Prof. Marc
  **Choisy**](https://www.ndm.ox.ac.uk/team/marc-choisy), [Prof. Sophie
  **Yacoub**](https://www.tropicalmedicine.ox.ac.uk/team/sophie-yacoub), [Assoc.
  Prof. Sarah **Sparrow**](https://eng.ox.ac.uk/people/sarah-sparrow), and
  [Prof. Moritz **Kraemer**](https://www.biology.ox.ac.uk/people/moritz-kraemer)
  {% endrenderTemplate %}
</section>

